# Supported OpenMetadata versions for acceptance tests.
# First non-comment line is the default used by `make testacc` (no OM_VERSION set).
# To add a new version:
#   1. Add the version here.
#   2. Run:  make update-test-compose OM_VERSION=<version>
#      This downloads the official docker-compose.yml into docker/test/<version>/.
#   3. Copy docker/test/<existing>/.env to docker/test/<version>/.env and update
#      OPENMETADATA_VERSION.
#   4. Commit docker/test/<version>/.env and docker/test/<version>/docker-compose.yml.
